        "original_id": "859c02bc-dddb-5ade-953d-db9dbc87e6f3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Waco, McLennan County, Texas, Idaho Falls, Bonneville County, Idaho, United States\n- Organizations: City of Waco\n- Products: Waco Regional Airport, Idaho Falls Regional Airport\n- Codes: ACT, KACT, KIDA, IDA\n\nFacts:\n- Waco Regional Airport has the IATA code ACT, the ICAO code KACT, and the FAA LID ACT.\n- Waco Regional Airport is located five miles northwest of Waco in McLennan County, Texas.\n- Waco Regional Airport is owned by the City of Waco.\n- Idaho Falls Regional Airport has the IATA code KIDA and the ICAO code IDA.\n- Idaho Falls Regional Airport is a city-owned public-use airport.\n- Idaho Falls Regional Airport is located two nautical miles northwest of the central business district of Idaho Falls in Bonneville County, Idaho, United States.",
